defineContextHelp('AdminTo','computers','A local administrator assignment can permit broad changes on the endpoint when effective authorization and remote/local access conditions allow it.','Validate current local/policy group membership, nested groups, token filtering, logon policy and the actual supported access method.','Remove only the unnecessary local-administrator assignment at its real source, preserving approved device-management access.','Rescan local and policy-derived groups, test intended management access and check alternative privileged assignments.','Changing a shared administrator assignment can lock out support or service management.');
defineContextHelp('CanPSRemote|ExecuteDCOM','computers','This is potential remote-management authorization on a computer, separate from verified privileged execution.','Check the exact protocol/application endpoint authorization, service state, firewall path and authentication restrictions.','Narrow unnecessary remote-management assignments at the local group, policy or application authorization that supplies them.','Recollect the assignment and test the approved management workflow through its intended endpoint.','Removing a shared remoting assignment can disrupt legitimate operations even when no administrator capability was established.');
